  "description": "The train type group of a station board row (WidgetTrainTypes.groupOf for a row of unknown service kind, the iPhone's TrainTypeGroups.group): a bus first, then the operator id (Italo, an operator outside Italy), then the letters that open the category or line label without spaces, in capitals: a bus code, an international code, a high-speed code, an intercity code, the whole label matching the regional pattern (a line label such as «S5» or «RE8», not a category with its train number); otherwise no group (null), and such a row is never hidden. Codes and pattern: contracts/shared-data/v1/train-type-groups-v1.json.",
